&lt;li&gt;Strong network across commerce, retail, or marketplace companies—particularly within ads or monetization teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience selling enterprise or platform solutions (e.g. SaaS, cloud, or media monetization).&lt;/li&gt;
