&lt;li&gt;Entrepreneurial mindset with high ownership and the ability to operate effectively in a fast-growing, ambiguous environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record of building and scaling partnerships through a consultative, solution-oriented approach.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong commercial acumen, with experience structuring and closing complex, high-value deals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and relationship-building skills, with the ability to establish trust with senior partners.&lt;/li&gt;
