&lt;li&gt;Forecast and monitor performance, proactively identifying optimization levers and growth risks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and drive portfolio‑level upsell and cross‑sell strategies, prioritizing accounts with the highest upside and strategic value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead data‑driven negotiations and trade‑off discussions with clients (e.g., budget, pricing, tests) to unlock incremental and durable revenue.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
