&lt;p&gt;Moloco is a truly rewarding place to work and in an exciting period of growth, which you could be a part of. Join us today and apply now!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Impact You’ll Be Contributing to Moloco&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will lead the product strategy for CTV User Understanding within Moloco Ads, building the foundational capabilities that power identity, features, and signals across our machine learning-driven ads platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This includes defining how we:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish durable, privacy-conscious identity across devices (e.g., connecting CTV environments with mobile signals)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extract maximum value from 1P and 3P data sources (e.g., UPT, Lotame, and future signals)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enable advertisers to use their 1P data to target and exclude specific audiences at scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your work will directly influence model performance, targeting accuracy, and overall advertiser outcomes across Moloco’s ecosystem.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Group Product Manager at Moloco, you will operate at the intersection of machine learning, large-scale data systems, and performance advertising. You’ll partner closely with engineering and data science to define and execute on a roadmap that turns complex data into measurable business impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role requires a first-principles thinker who thrives in ambiguity, can context switch effectively, and has a track record of building and scaling products from 0→1 through growth. You will own a critical, horizontal layer of the ads stack and play a key role in shaping the future of targeting and identity in a privacy-first world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How Do I Know if the Role is Right For Me?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;9–12 years of experience, with 8+ years in Product Management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record owning platform, infrastructure, or data-driven products end-to-end&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience defining ambiguous problem spaces and translating them into clear product strategies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical mindset with the ability to make decisions in data-sparse environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep curiosity about customer needs and ability to translate them into scalable solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable operating in fast-paced, highly collaborative, and globally distributed teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in ad tech, CTV, identity, targeting, or machine learning systems is strongly preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record of building and scaling B2B products, ideally in high-growth environments&lt;/li&gt;
