&lt;li&gt;Embrace diverse perspectives and promote respectful disagreement resolution to achieve the best outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills, experiences, and mindset that will help you succeed&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
