&lt;li&gt;3+ years of experience in digital advertising, eCommerce, ad tech, or customer-facing roles; Commerce Media or mobile internet industry experience is preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical mindset; comfortable working with data, drawing insights, and translating numbers into clear recommendations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills with the ability to build trusted, lasting relationships with customers.&lt;/li&gt;
