&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to build and scale accounting operations from the ground up and driving process transformation&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to balance strategic vision with hands-on execution in a lean, pre-IPO setting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Resilient and adaptable, with the ability to provide clarity and direction while leading through ambiguity.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Inclusive people leader with a track record of developing and empowering high-performing teams.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
