&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Moloco:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Moloco builds some of the most powerful AI advertising solutions in the world. Our name—short for &quot;machine learning company&quot;—reflects our core mission: democratizing access to the advanced AI that has historically been reserved for tech giants. Led by machine learning pioneers who built some of the most successful ad systems at Google, including YouTube&#39;s monetization engine and key search advertising technologies, we&#39;re transforming how businesses grow and compete in the digital economy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Built with AI from day one, Moloco’s planet-scale machine learning platform powers a suite of solutions for advertising growth and monetization. &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.moloco.com/solutions/moloco-ads&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Moloco Ads&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; is an AI-powered platform that delivers real business outcomes for mobile app marketers through performance-based user acquisition. &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.moloco.com/solutions/moloco-commerce-media&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Moloco Commerce Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; enables retailers and marketplaces to build revenue-generating ad businesses that balance user experience and advertiser performance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Moloco is headquartered in Silicon Valley, with offices in Seattle, New York, San Francisco, Seoul, Beijing, Singapore, Gurgaon, Tokyo, Shanghai, London, Tel Aviv, and Berlin.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Moloco is a truly rewarding place to work and in an exciting period of growth, which you could be a part of. Join us today and apply now!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Impact You’ll Be Contributing to Moloco&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will own the product strategy for CTV Advertiser Success within Moloco Ads, building the capabilities that help advertisers understand, trust, and improve campaign performance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This includes:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Owning the roadmap for insights and reporting products that deliver reliable, transparent, and actionable data to advertisers for campaign performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Driving advertiser outcomes by partnering with Data Science to analyze, diagnose, and improve campaign performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Developing integrations with key partners across the CTV measurement ecosystem to enable holistic performance visibility&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your work will directly influence advertiser trust, performance outcomes, and long-term adoption of Moloco’s CTV solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Product Manager at Moloco, you will work at the intersection of ads performance, data, and measurement. You’ll partner cross-functionally with engineering, data science, and business teams to define and execute a roadmap that makes campaign performance more transparent and actionable for advertisers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role requires strong product execution, the ability to translate complex data into intuitive user experiences, and a deep understanding of advertiser needs. You will play a key role in shaping how Moloco delivers insights, reporting, and ecosystem connectivity in a rapidly evolving CTV landscape.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How Do I Know if the Role is Right For Me?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4–8 years of experience in Product Management or closely related roles in ad tech, data products, or performance marketing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with campaign performance data, analytics, or measurement systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong ability to translate complex data into clear product experiences and insights&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of driving cross-functional execution with engineering, data science, and business teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High attention to detail with a strong sense of ownership and accountability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable operating in ambiguous, fast-paced environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with CTV, programmatic advertising, or measurement/attribution ecosystems is strongly preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication skills with the ability to influence stakeholders and align teams around product direction&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
