&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Software Engineer on the Experiment Platform team, you will lead the design and evolution of high-leverage systems that shape how Moloco runs experiments across products. You will own important technical areas end-to-end, drive sound engineering decisions in ambiguous problem spaces, and build platforms that improve the speed, safety, and trustworthiness of experimentation company-wide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is well-suited for engineers who combine strong execution with technical judgment, enjoy working across backend and data system boundaries, and want to raise the quality bar for an internal platform used by many teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the design and implementation of major components across experiment management services, configuration delivery systems, and analysis pipelines.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own technical decisions for platform areas that require balancing correctness, reliability, performance, and ease of adoption.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve the trustworthiness of experimentation by strengthening system design, observability, data quality, and operational standards.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with engineers, data scientists, statisticians, and stakeholders to turn ambiguous requirements into scalable platform capabilities.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor other engineers through design discussions, code reviews, and pragmatic technical leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
