&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a Staff Software Engineer to join our Ads Data Warehouse team, which builds and evolves the core data infrastructure that powers all data-driven products and analytics across the company.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Data Warehouse team is responsible for foundational systems such as data lineage, data catalog, access control, and compliance frameworks—enabling teams to securely and efficiently leverage data for decision-making, analytics, ML modeling, and Ads optimization.&lt;/p&gt;
