&lt;li&gt;Lead the design and evolution of core data systems, including data lineage, metadata management, and data catalog systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with cross-functional leaders to establish data governance, access control, and compliance frameworks that ensure data integrity and regulatory alignment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and scale high-reliability systems that power both real-time and batch data workflows across Ads and analytics use cases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Influence engineering culture by defining best practices for data modeling, observability, and developer experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive cross-org initiatives to improve data quality, discoverability, and system adoption.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor senior engineers and help develop technical leadership across the data and infrastructure organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a trusted technical advisor to product and engineering leadership on strategy and scaling challenges.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree or higher in Computer Science, Engineering, or a related technical field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of experience in software engineering, with a strong focus on data infrastructure, platform systems, or distributed architectures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience designing and scaling large-scale data platforms or data-intensive systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong proficiency in Golang, Python, or Java.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of distributed systems, metadata management, and data modeling principles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with cloud data platforms (e.g., GCP, AWS, Azure) and data orchestration frameworks (e.g., Airflow, Beam, Dataflow, Kafka).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to define and lead complex technical initiatives that span multiple teams or domains.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills, with the ability to influence and align stakeholders across engineering, product, and compliance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
